rpi-headtracker (0.1.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * First Debian packages.
  * rpi-headtracker: program, web pages and face models, a private copy of
    ONNX Runtime, system user "headtracker", systemd services for the USB
    joystick and the program, udev rule for /dev/hidg0, USB device mode in
    config.txt.
  * rpi-headtracker-wifi: own open Wi-Fi "HeadTracker-XXXX" when the Pi is on
    no Wi-Fi network, setup page on port 80 of the hotspot (captive portal),
    permission for the user "headtracker" to change the Wi-Fi.

